# Vite `--mode desktop` env — loaded on top of .env for the Tauri desktop build ONLY.
#
# Committed on purpose: it holds no secrets, and it is what makes `isDesktop` true at build
# time (src/lib/platform.ts). Vite inlines it, so the desktop branches are constant-folded and
# the browser bundle never carries them.
#
# For a RELEASE build against your deployed backend, put the production URLs in a gitignored
# .env.desktop.local next to this file:
#   VITE_API_URL=https://api.tendto.example
#   VITE_AUTH_URL=https://auth.tendto.example
#   VITE_POWERSYNC_URL=https://sync.tendto.example
VITE_PLATFORM=desktop
